Its folder olsen-sources/ holds the source files of the sediment solvers sediDriftFoam and sediDriftFoam2 by Nils Reidar B. Olsen, unchanged, under the GNU General Public License version 3 or later (text in LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt), as is cpp/olsenRatingCurve.H. They are shipped as an aggregate: aXqua neither links nor imports them, the installer compiles them into separate programs, and aXqua runs those programs as external solvers. The GPL therefore applies to these files and the programs built from them, not to aXqua.
